WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.130 --> 00:00:04.910
- [Interviewer] All
right, Glow, welcome back.

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:05.950
- [Glow] Hi.

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:07.390
