00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:38.540
but the stress of it...

00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:40.390
- Right, breaks everything else down.

00:03:42.202 --> 00:03:44.980
- [Interviewer] That's what I've seen.

00:03:44.980 --> 00:03:49.010
- Yeah, so, I'm kinda excited
to see what happens next.

00:03:49.010 --> 00:03:52.450
And I'm always peeling and looking through

00:03:52.450 --> 00:03:56.240
the things on the internet
for RVs in different places.

00:03:56.240 --> 00:03:58.640
So, keeping everything positive

00:03:58.640 --> 00:04:01.430
and just waiting to see what happens next!

00:04:01.430 --> 00:04:02.263
- [Interviewer] Well, it's nice to see

00:04:02.263 --> 00:04:05.360
