actually making improvement.

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:06.486
- I'm so grateful.

00:04:06.486 --> 00:04:07.410
- [Interviewer] You're one of the few.

00:04:07.410 --> 00:04:08.540
- And I'm very grateful.

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:11.190
So grateful and so appreciative

00:04:11.190 --> 00:04:15.220
