00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:22.954
So it's kinda cool.

00:04:22.954 --> 00:04:23.787
- [Interviewer] That's great.

00:04:23.787 --> 00:04:25.579
- [Glow] Yeah.

00:04:25.579 --> 00:04:27.560
