00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:48.250
But I am establishing a doctor

00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:51.940
and I'm going to be
going to a psychiatrist,

00:04:51.940 --> 00:04:52.918
I believe it is.

00:04:52.918 --> 00:04:53.751
- [Interviewer] No, that's great.

00:04:53.751 --> 00:04:54.740
- [Glow] Yeah, to try to
talk about some things

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:57.670
