check it out, can't hurt.

00:05:02.500 --> 00:05:03.335
- [Interviewer] Good for you.

00:05:03.335 --> 00:05:04.320
(Glow laughing)

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:05.740
- [Glow] And if it
doesn't work, well okay,

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:06.590
